      "default": "off",
      "information": { "en": "Add paramagnetic, diamagnetic, and separated-total susceptibility maps. Requires at least three GRE magnitude and unfiltered phase echoes. R2*-QSM needs equally spaced echoes. No spin-echo acquisition is needed." }
